    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Weight stable at her dry weight; no fatigue, fever, or appetite change</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision with reading glasses; no eye pain</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Reduced hearing in crowded rooms, right more than left; no tinnitus or vertigo</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, orthopnea, or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>Cough resolved; breathless only on long stair climbs</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Regular bowel habit; no bleeding or reflux</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Positive</td><td>Urgency on furosemide days; no incontinence or dysuria</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No falls, joint pain, or change in gait</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new or changing skin lesions</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No memory change, headache, weakness, or imbalance</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; sleeps well; PHQ-2 score 0</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No polyuria, polydipsia, or heat or cold intolerance</td></tr><tr><td>Hematologic</td><td>Negative</td><td>No easy bruising or bleeding</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>13 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
