    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with her consent. She has a written health care directive and has named a health care agent; a copy is now in the chart. She wants full treatment for reversible illness, including hospital care. She would not want prolonged mechanical ventilation or resuscitation if recovery to independent living were unlikely. She will review these wishes with her agent. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
